&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  This operation can not be canceled.
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;AnyDialog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

