&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improvement Example&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
When the purpose is fixed, it should be extracted as a distinct purpose-specific component (or a distinct variant). This allows the use of specific types, eliminating duplicate implementations on the calling side.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

